  "description": "After graduating from high school, the two begin living together—a long-held dream—and envision a sweet daily life.\nHowever, their happiness is short-lived; Baekya grows frustrated as Lee-hyeon consistently avoids intimacy, while Lee-hyeon becomes increasingly bothered by a classmate who keeps hovering around Baekya.\nNow closer than ever, they find it impossible to hide their true feelings or innermost thoughts from one another.\nAmidst a shared life filled with a mix of excitement, anxiety, jealousy, and desire, the tension between them steadily intensifies...\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/proactive_romance)",
